            <div xml:id="d478">

                <pb facs="0461" n="453" xml:id="pg453"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">825.51/1148: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Chile</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Bowers</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1939-09-21T11:00:00-04:00">September 21,
                            1939—11 a.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received September 21—11 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>156. Notified Wachholtz last night of allocation of 5 million credit by
                    Export-Import Bank. He accepted with appreciation and will make public
                    announcement here today. He plans to send purchasing agent to the United States
                    in the immediate future.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bowers</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
